{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Camera｜流程图\n原生更新入口与单次 GG 求值／发布链。[[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|结构图]] · [[Camera/结构|结构文档]]。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机覆盖恢复.canvas|覆盖恢复子图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|模式求值子图]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1890,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. LevelTick 选择原生 Manager 入口。\n非暂停／要求 full tick → UpdateCamera(dt)。\n暂停且 provider 支持 → 下方摄影入口。\n两个入口在 NotActivated／Stopped 直接返回。\nRunning 的 UpdateCamera → 原生 DoUpdateCamera。\nGG 目标 UpdateViewTarget → Prepare；\n当前目标→待切目标，原始 dt 有限非负。\n摄影分支不进入该 GG 求值链。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "look-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "0. HeroComponent::Input_LookMouse / Input_LookStick\n→ AddControllerYawInput / AddControllerPitchInput\n→ Controller.ControlRotation。\nIMC_Default / IMC_MouseLook 配置 IA_Look / IA_MouseLook。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Prepare 内 UpdateCameraModes 取模式类。\nDetermineCameraModeDelegate → Hero 的覆盖／默认类。\n委托缺失或类非法返回 Failure，\n不沿用旧活动栈掩盖缺失配置。\nPawnData.DefaultCameraMode 提供默认类。\n原目标／组件／Controller／World 与配置在调用内校验。\n[[Camera/结构#与其他模块如何交互|职责与接口]]",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "push",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. PushCameraMode(Class) → Result。\n合法类复用实例并置顶，已在顶也可成功。\n非法类/配置或空活动栈明确失败。\n不跳过 Push 后继续旧栈，\n不转 UCameraComponent::GetCameraView 业务兜底。\n只有 Push 成功才 EvaluateStack。\n显式 Restart 先重建原 GG Stack/实例池，\n与日常 ClearStack 保留池的语义分开。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. EvaluateStack(dt, View, Request) → Result。\nThirdPerson.UpdateView → 原 CMC → 外侧投影／滤波，\n只合成 TargetOffset.Y，输出期望 View／Request。\nInitial 保构图；不适用回收；Invalid 明确 Failure。\n再混合 View／聚合请求，完整成功才输出。\n随后 Offset／唯一碰撞；内部推进不承诺回滚。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|真实调用与分支]]",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "offset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. UpdateCameraOffsetAlpha → ApplyCameraOffset。\n消费已接受单槽；Set 属申请阶段。\n非法 Set：Error/Invalid、申请入口状态保持。\n[[Camera/模式栈实现#Offset 单槽所有权|申请契约]]。\n合法 dt0 不推进正混合时间；零时间可立即到目标。\n非法 dt/alpha/运行算术明确失败，不重置归零。\nalpha>0 且 Offset 非近零才施加：旋转、位置叠加，\n合法有限 FOV 按正常输出规则钳至5–170。\ntoken 管所有权；GA 先 Clear 的行为不在 Setter 事务内。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. Manager 预览与发布准入。\nPrepared.TryGetCandidateView → 局部候选。\nApplyCameraModifiers 后先校验候选。\nCommitPreparedCameraView 消费同一 Prepared，\n复核原上下文后写组件/Controller及局部输出，\n不二次求值；候选不保存到成员跨帧复用。\n原生当前/待切目标混合 → 摄影 → Fill：\n原始 Blend 标量与最终 POV 必须有效，\n包括 AllowPhotographyMode=false 路径。\n完整有效后写唯一原生当前/上一帧 Cache，\n才授予 HasConfirmedNativeCameraView。\nPrepare 内部及任意外部副作用不承诺全局回滚。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "失败 / Stopped：RejectCameraPublication 保存原失败身份。\nPrepare／修饰／Commit／混合／发布失败统一停止；\n受控 DoUpdate 恢复原生两帧 POV／时间与附加 PP。\n任意 Setter／modifier 副作用不是全局事务。\n已有 confirmed → 保留该 Cache；首次失败无确认，\nLP 返回 false，输入初始化仍独立继续。\nUpdateCamera／UpdateCameraPhotographyOnly 不再写 Cache。\n重复 Ready 不重启，不自动重试。\nRestartCameraEvaluation 只接受原失败 Target／Component，\n复核原 PC／World；GG 重建栈后尝试一次。\n失败仍 Stopped，不换源。\n[[Camera/结构#发布准入与显式重启|原身份 Restart]]",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "collision",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. ResolveCameraPenetration 保护 Offset 后位置。\n有效启用请求：本次至多一次 ECC_Camera，忽略 Target。\nRadius>0 sweep；合法0 line trace。\n收近立即；正 Recovery 渐复，合法0立即恢复。\n正常禁用/合法退化路径按配置处理；\n缺失依赖、非法参数或算术返回失败，不归零替代。\nPrepare 成功才形成不透明、可移动的 Prepared。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|求值子图]]",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 1160,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "provider-ready",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ready：Hero 的两个真实入口先调用 ConsumeLocalCameraProviderReady。\nDataAvailable→DataInitialized（在 InputComponent 空值 guard 前）；InitializePlayerInput（在代次/释放资源前）。\n原 Hero/Pawn/PC/World/LP/Extension/PawnData/Camera/Manager 验证后 → ActivateCameraEvaluation。\n原身份丢失才停止旧回调尾部；镜头失败明确诊断，原上下文有效时输入初始化继续。\n未就绪按真实生命周期返回，不轮询；重复 Ready 不调用 Restart，也不新增 Ready 权威状态。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "projection",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "UGGYGOLocalPlayer::GetProjectionData\n调用前核对原 LP/PC/World/Manager 关联，\n并要求 HasConfirmedNativeCameraView。\n无关联/NotActivated/未确认种子 → false。\nStopped 已有确认可读取保留 Cache。\nSuper 只写局部 ProjectionScratch；\n返回后再核对关联、确认资格及原生成功结果。\n仅成功才写 OutProjectionData；失败保持 Out。\n不 Activate/Restart，不持有 POV/确认副本，\n不新增帧时钟或投影缓存。\n[[System/结构|System]]",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 1470,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "photography-only",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "暂停摄影分支：UpdateCameraPhotographyOnly()\nLevelTick 虚派发 → GG override 检查准入。\nNotActivated／Stopped → return，\n不调用 Super，不写两帧 POV／时间戳。\nRunning → Super::UpdateCameraPhotographyOnly()\n→ UpdatePhotographyCamera → FillCameraCache。\n保持原生行为：作用域外 POV setter 拒绝发布，\n时间戳仍按原生 Fill 规则写入。\n不追加 GG 求值、不授予新的 confirmed，\n不改变 Controller 的暂停 full tick 政策。\n[[Camera/结构#发布准入与显式重启|发布契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e0",
      "fromNode": "look-input",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "engine",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "ControlRotation → Pawn ViewRotation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "engine",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "choose",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Running 的普通更新：GG UpdateViewTarget → Prepare"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "choose",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "push",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "有效 Class；无效返回 Failure"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "push",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "evaluate",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Push Success → Evaluate Result"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "evaluate",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "offset",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "OutView + OutRequest"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "offset",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "collision",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Offset 后最终位置"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "push",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "empty",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Push/栈失败 → Manager Stopped"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "empty",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "projection",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "已有确认的保留 Cache 只读；首次失败 false"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "fromNode": "collision",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "output",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Prepare Success → 同一 Prepared"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "fromNode": "provider-ready",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "engine",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "实际 Ready → 原身份 Activate"
    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "fromNode": "engine",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "empty",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Stopped / 管线 Result Failure"
    },
    {
      "id": "e11",
      "fromNode": "output",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "projection",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "原生 Cache + 确认资格（只读）"
    },
    {
      "id": "e12",
      "fromNode": "output",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "empty",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "修饰/Commit/混合/发布校验失败"
    },
    {
      "id": "e13",
      "fromNode": "engine",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "photography-only",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "暂停、不要求 full tick 且 provider 支持 → 摄影入口"
    }
  ]
}
